sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as Eval-Hub<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Adapter as Garak Adapter<br/>(K8s Job Pod)
    participant CredSources as Credential Sources<br/>(Env/Secrets/SA Token)
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines<br/>API
    participant LLM as Target LLM<br/>Endpoint
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible<br/>Storage
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes<br/>API Server

    Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Evaluation Triggered

    EvalHub->>Adapter: Evaluation Configuration<br/>(model endpoint, probes, params)

    Note over Adapter,CredSources: Multi-Layer Credential Resolution

    Adapter->>CredSources: 1. Check role-specific env vars<br/>(OPENAICOMPATIBLE_API_KEY)
    CredSources-->>Adapter: Found / Not Found
    Adapter->>CredSources: 2. Check KFP-mounted secrets<br/>(/mnt/model-auth/)
    CredSources-->>Adapter: Found / Not Found
    Adapter->>CredSources: 3. Check eval-hub secrets<br/>(/var/run/secrets/model/)
    CredSources-->>Adapter: Found / Not Found
    Adapter->>CredSources: 4. Fallback to generic API_KEY
    CredSources-->>Adapter: Key or "DUMMY" sentinel

    alt Simple Mode (in-pod)
        Note over Adapter,LLM: Garak executes in same pod
        Adapter->>LLM: Garak Red-Teaming Probes<br/>Auth: Model API Key
        LLM-->>Adapter: Probe Responses
    else KFP Mode (remote pipeline)
        Note over Adapter,KFP: Garak executes in separate KFP pod
        Adapter->>CredSources: Read SA token<br/>(/var/run/secrets/kubernetes.io/)
        CredSources-->>Adapter: ServiceAccount Token
        Adapter->>KFP: Submit Pipeline Run<br/>Auth: Bearer SA Token
        KFP-->>Adapter: Run ID
        loop Poll for completion
            Adapter->>KFP: Check Run Status<br/>Auth: Bearer SA Token
            KFP-->>Adapter: Status (Running/Complete)
        end
        KFP->>LLM: Garak Probes (in KFP pod)<br/>Auth: Model API Key
        LLM-->>KFP: Probe Responses
    end

    Note over Adapter,S3: Results Upload

    Adapter->>CredSources: Resolve AWS credentials<br/>(env vars or K8s Secret)
    CredSources-->>Adapter: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID<br/>AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY

    opt AWS creds from K8s Secret
        Adapter->>K8sAPI: Read Secret<br/>Auth: SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>Adapter: AWS Credentials
    end

    Adapter->>Adapter: Sanitize config<br/>(redact API keys)
    Adapter->>S3: Upload results + sanitized config<br/>Auth: AWS IAM (boto3)<br/>Protocol: HTTPS
    S3-->>Adapter: Upload Confirmation

    Adapter-->>EvalHub: Evaluation Complete
